?><!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Connect ChatGPT to BDC</title><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"></head><body><main style="max-width:42rem;margin:4rem auto;font:16px system-ui;line-height:1.5"><h1>Connect ChatGPT to BDC</h1><p><strong><?=e((string)$valid['client_name'])?></strong> is requesting permission to view draft event rounds and eligible competitors, and to stage competitor additions for your explicit approval.</p><p>No competitor is added until a Super Admin approves the proposal in Integration Review.</p><form method="post"><?php foreach(['client_id'=>$client,'redirect_uri'=>$redirect,'state'=>$state,'scope'=>$scope,'code_challenge'=>$challenge,'code_challenge_method'=>$method,'response_type'=>'code'] as $k=>$v):?><input type="hidden" name="<?=e($k)?>" value="<?=e($v)?>"><?php endforeach?><button name="decision" value="allow">Allow</button> <button name="decision" value="deny">Deny</button></form></main></body></html>
